# Frontend folder placement

`app/frontend/pages/**` holds Inertia route entrypoints only (usually `index.tsx`).

Put tables, forms, form sections, work queues, review tables, filters, and related helpers in `app/frontend/domains/<Domain>/`.

Put cross-cutting shells and shared presentational widgets (auth paper, index templates, record show board pieces, form bands) in `app/frontend/features/`.

Put general-purpose primitives in `app/frontend/components/`.

Do not create `FormInputs/`, `ReviewTable/`, `WorkQueue.tsx`, or similar component trees under `pages/`. Import them into the page from `@/domains/...`.

When the same presentational widget appears in more than one domain or page, extract it into `features/` or `components/` immediately. Domain files compose shared widgets; they do not host private copies of them. Follow `.cursor/rules/no-ui-duplication.mdc`.
